        "description": "MoonAnchors are how MoonShade attaches to your vehicle. They're the compatibility layer between the canopy and your specific surface — the reason MoonShade works on a Sprinter, a Jeep, a teardrop trailer, and a beach house fence without drilling into any of them. Which anchor is right for you depends on your vehicle type and how permanent you want the mount to be."
